# Exception: small (~1.4MB) zip of the frozen Phase 2 processed split,
# committed so Colab training notebooks can `git clone` it directly instead
# of requiring a manual upload step. The unzipped .jsonl files themselves
# stay gitignored above -- git must be told not to ignore the parent dirs
# either, or it won't descend far enough to see the exception.
!data/processed/civil_comments/
data/processed/civil_comments/*
!data/processed/civil_comments/civil_comments_processed.zip
.DS_Store
/models/

